oInfo:323976839":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"323976839","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/8/f/e/7/highres_323976839.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:404707702":{"__typename":"Member","id":"404707702","name":"Srishti Jain","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:323976839"}},"PhotoInfo:299489875":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"299489875","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/7/4/b/3/highres_299489875.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:302242639":{"__typename":"Member","id":"302242639","name":"Charles Fortier","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:299489875"}},"PhotoInfo:310406269":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"310406269","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/6/6/9/d/highres_310406269.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:360755670":{"__typename":"Member","id":"360755670","name":"Jake Fox","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:310406269"}},"PhotoInfo:321506754":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"321506754","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/6/8/8/2/highres_321506754.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:9879680":{"__typename":"Member","id":"9879680","name":"Vivian","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:321506754"}},"PhotoInfo:326164856":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"326164856","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/1/2/f/8/highres_326164856.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:483011604":{"__typename":"Member","id":"483011604","name":"zibeth Milroy","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:326164856"}},"Event:316200713":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316200713","title":"👻 Ghost Walking Tour of Queen West \u0026 Yonge Street 🌙","dateTime":"2026-10-15T18:30:00-04:00","description":"# 👻 Ghost Tour: Queen West \u0026 Yonge Street 🌙\n\n### Restless Spirits, Strange Stories \u0026 Toronto After Dark\n\nThe thing about ghosts is… **they don’t always stay where they died.**\nSometimes they linger in places they loved. Sometimes they remain where unfinished business keeps them tethered. And sometimes, apparently, they just really like a particular chair.\n\nOn this walking tour, we'll explore some of the stranger stories connected to **Queen West and Yonge Street** — from hospitals and theatres to music halls, historic buildings, and some rather unexpected places.\nSome of these people met their fate on these streets.\n**Most didn't.**\n\nGhosts are funny that way.\n\nThis is a **curated storytelling experience**, combining Toronto history, local legends, and some of the city's more unusual ghost stories.\nAnd don't worry — we're not going inside the buildings.\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 👻 What We'll Explore\n\nWe'll begin outside the **Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts** and make our way east toward Yonge Street.\nAlong the way, we'll hear stories about:\n\n* 🔫 **Don't play with guns… again**\n* 🙏 **“This is my hospital,” said the Nun**\n* 🎶 **The spirit who stayed for the music**\n* 🪑 **Who sat in that chair?**\n* 👻 Other strange stories, unexplained encounters, and Toronto legends\n\nWe'll finish at **Yonge-Dundas Square**.\nThe walk will take approximately **90 minutes**, depending on the pace of the group.\n\nWe'll remain outdoors throughout the experience and will **not be entering any buildings**.\n\n***\n\n## 🌙 A Little About the Experience\n\nThis isn't simply a walk where someone points out a few supposedly haunted buildings.\nI've researched the stories, developed the route, and brought the different pieces together into a single experience.\nSome stories are rooted in Toronto history.\nSome have been passed down as local legends.\nAnd some leave you wondering whether there might actually be something to them.\n**You can decide what you believe.** 👻\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** Outside the **Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts**\n🫎 **Look for me in my Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **6:30 PM sharp**\nI will only wait **5 minutes**.\n**Early is on time. On time is late.**\n🚶‍♂️ **Pace:** Steady walking pace\n🏁 **End Point:** **Yonge-Dundas Square**\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$10 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\nThis is a **curated ghost-walking experience**, rather than one of our regular social walks. The route, stories, and history have been researched and brought together specifically for this experience.\nThe fee helps support the time and work that goes into creating these walks.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🧥 Weather-appropriate clothing\n💧 Water\n📱 Your phone for photos — if you're brave enough. 👻\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis experience is great for:\n\n* 👻 People who love ghost stories\n* 🏙️ Anyone interested in Toronto's strange history\n* 🎭 Theatre and music lovers\n* 🕯️ People who enjoy local legends and unexplained stories\n* 🚶 People looking for something different to do in the evening\n* 😂 Anyone who likes being a little scared without taking it too seriously\n\nYou don't have to believe in ghosts.\nYou just have to enjoy a good story.\n\n***\n\n**REMEMBER:** You're welcome to RSVP ahead of time or just show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be cancelled or changed, so please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\n\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email:\n📧 **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the ghosts.**\n**Stay for the stories.**\n**Leave wondering what you just heard.** 👻🌙","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/no-such-thing-as-bad-weather/events/316200713/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535754970"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535754970"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"CASH","currency":"CAD","amount":10},"group":{"__ref":"Group:35508019"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":16,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:9334356"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:185096607"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:419346123"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:300039238"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:241792367"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:339173099"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:394990147"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:264851732"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:394508703"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:340305064"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:341980331"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:404707702"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:302242639"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:360755670"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Memb