-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**IMPORTANT:**\n*A **minimum number** is required to proceed as a \"group\". Once CONFIRMED, I'll collect payment in advance in a week or so. **This meetup is ONLY for the group purchase.***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**DETAILS:** 🎟️\n\n* Sign up to the waitlist to join us!\n* At the time of posting, tickets are $25 ($20 + SCSC's $5 non-refundable RSVP fee)\n* Etransfers will be required in advance\n* All ticket sales are final (as per ticket seller)\n\nHere's a sample of [their last \"Open Ended\"](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/open-ended-a-storytelling-night-tickets-1994954486572) event:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/open-ended-a-storytelling-night-tickets-1994954486572\n\nLooking forward to seeing both new and familiar faces!","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/the-cuw-club-singlewomenwithoutchildren/events/316571915/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":2,"rsvpState":"JOIN_APPROVAL","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536170978"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536170978"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:36346103"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":4,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:2408954"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:281823796"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:202299632"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:318134952"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Gladstone House","address":"1214 Queen St W, Toronto, ON M6J 1J6, Canada","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316571915\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","