ple who want to connect for different reasons—partnerships, potential investment, help building a leveraged business model, or job opportunities. This meet-up is a casual but **structured** way to meet in person, quickly understand what you’re working on, and determine clear next steps.\n\n### **📍 Location**\n\n**Second Cup**\n4841 Yonge St · North York, ON\n\n### **🕓 Time**\n\n**Aug 20th, 2026**\n**6:00 PM – 9:00 PM**\n\n***\n\n## **💵 Attendance Fee (Important)**\n\n**$10 for business-related attendance**, including:\n\n* business model feedback / guidance\n* partnership discussions\n* investment-related conversations\n* strategic support / “how do I move forward?” planning\n\n*If you’re coming for both job + business advice, it’s considered business-related and the $10 applies.*\n\n***\n\n## **✅ RSVP (Required)**\n\nPlease RSVP so I can plan seating and manage time fairly for everyone.\n\n***\n\n## **What this meet-up is (and isn’t)**\n\n**This is an intro + screening session** designed to:\n\n* meet you briefly\n* clarify your direction\n* identify fit\n* suggest the next best step\n\n**This is not** a full consulting session, a guaranteed job interview, or a promise of investment/partnership. Those decisions happen after follow-up, if there’s a fit.\n\n***\n\n## **Format / Timeboxing**\n\nTo keep it fair, conversations will be **timeboxed (approximately 15–20 minutes per person)** depending on turnout. You may stay and listen to other discussions.\n\n***\n\n## **What to bring (typed + prepared)**\n\n### **If you want help with a business model**\n\nBring a **typed 1-page plan** (rough is fine) including:\n\n* what the business does\n* who the customer is\n* how it makes money\n* what you’ve done so far\n* what you need help with right now\n\n### **If you’re looking for a job**\n\nBring **two printed copies** of your resume.\n\n### **If you want to partner with me**\n\nBring a **typed outline** including:\n\n* your concept (clear + simple)\n* **your responsibilities** (what you will personally do each week)\n* **your expectation of my responsibilities**\n* what success looks like (timeline + goals)\n\n### **If you’re seeking investment (or want to discuss it)**\n\nBring a **typed summary** including:\n\n* what traction you have (sales/users/LOIs/partnerships—anything real)\n* how much capital you’re seeking\n* exactly how the funds would be used\n* why you’re the person/team to execute\n\n***\n\nIf this sounds like you, join me at **Second Cup on Oct 15th from 6:00 PM - 9:00 PM**.\n\nIf you are looking for a job, please use the meetup messaging feature to message me and I will add you to the event.","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/leadershift/events/316592748/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":13,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:532801086"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:532801086"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"PAYPAL","currency":"CAD","amount":10},"group":{"__ref":"Group:27689179"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":4,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:232844548"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:482398736"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:56492342"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:423147790"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Second Cup","address":"4841 Yonge St","city":"North York","state":"on","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316592748\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316592748","id":"316592748"},"metadata":{"__typename":"SearchMetadata","recId":"957a2275-a505-471f-a337-6fbe6021e9b3","recSource":"ml-popular-events-nearby-offline"}},"Photo